{"title": "Alka Yagnik Clarifies Health Status After Wheelchair Video", "summary": "Singer Alka Yagnik addressed public concern regarding her health after a video showed her in a wheelchair, following her Padma Bhushan honor. Fans had expressed worry about her condition. Yagnik clarified the situation, explaining what had happened to her.", "summary_points": ["Singer Alka Yagnik was seen in a wheelchair.", "The video emerged after she received the Padma Bhushan award.", "Fans expressed concern about her health.", "Yagnik subsequently clarified her health status.", "She explained the reason for being in a wheelchair."], "title_hi": "अलका याग्निक ने व्हीलचेयर वीडियो के बाद स्वास्थ्य स्थिति स्पष्ट की", "summary_hi": "गायिका अलका याग्निक ने पद्म भूषण सम्मान के बाद व्हीलचेयर में देखे जाने वाले एक वीडियो के बाद अपने स्वास्थ्य को लेकर सार्वजनिक चिंता को संबोधित किया। प्रशंसकों ने उनकी हालत को लेकर चिंता व्यक्त की थी। याग्निक ने स्थिति स्पष्ट करते हुए बताया कि उन्हें क्या हुआ था।", "summary_points_hi": ["गायिका अलका याग्निक को व्हीलचेयर में देखा गया था।", "यह वीडियो उन्हें पद्म भूषण पुरस्कार मिलने के बाद सामने आया।", "प्रशंसकों ने उनके स्वास्थ्य को लेकर चिंता व्यक्त की।", "याग्निक ने बाद में अपनी स्वास्थ्य स्थिति स्पष्ट की।", "उन्होंने व्हीलचेयर में होने का कारण बताया।"], "framing": {"center": "Centrist outlets focus on Alka Yagnik's clarification of her health status and the public concern that prompted it, particularly after her Padma Bhushan honor.", "right": "Right-leaning outlets highlight the severity of Alka Yagnik's condition, emphasizing her difficulty in walking and her appearance in a wheelchair, and her reported longing to hear her own voice."}, "framing_hi": {"center": "केंद्र-झुकाव वाले आउटलेट अलका याग्निक द्वारा अपनी स्वास्थ्य स्थिति के स्पष्टीकरण और पद्म भूषण सम्मान के बाद उत्पन्न हुई सार्वजनिक चिंता पर ध्यान केंद्रित करते हैं।", "right": "दक्षिणपंथी आउटलेट अलका याग्निक की स्थिति की गंभीरता पर जोर देते हैं, उनके चलने में कठिनाई और व्हीलचेयर में उनकी उपस्थिति, और अपनी आवाज सुनने की उनकी कथित लालसा को उजागर करते हैं।"}, "topic": "Society", "region": "India", "image_url": "https://www.indiablooms.com/storage/assets/n/2026/1782235883192632113.jpg", "sources": [{"source": "Republic World", "lean": "right", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Padma Awards 2026: Rohit Sharma Conferred With Padma Shri, Ex-Tennis Star Vijay Amritraj Receives Padma Bhushan"}, {"source": "India Today", "lean": "right", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMia0FVX3lxTE1zM1NYdGhiQlZkNDNZUjM5cE90YnI1Y3pxRW83eGFmSlpRNTdWa2luZ1hzMFdJSTVhdVc3OUd5ZHdJQzJZbVR6WTFhN21EMTRWZnZ5SjNMaHZaQ05abmFJOU4wZU13MkluOFpJ?oc=5", "headline": "President Murmu confers Padma Awards; CM Vijay sets assembly on fire; more"}, {"source": "Firstpost", "lean": "right", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Rohit Sharma receives Padma Shri award from President Droupadi Murmu | Watch video"}, {"source": "Mathrubhumi English", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Mammootty's Padma Bhushan recognition unfolds before an applauding son Dulquer Salmaan | VIDEO"}, {"source": "indiablooms.com", "lean": "unrated", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.indiablooms.com/photo-gallery/in-images-actor-mammootty-his-family-meet-pm-modi-after-padma-awards-ceremony/details", "headline": "In Images : Actor Mammootty , his family meet PM Modi after Padma Awards ceremony | Indiablooms - First Portal on Digital News Management"}, {"source": "indiagazette.com", "lean": "unrated", "language": "en", "url": "http://www.indiagazette.com/news/279142773/mammootty-receives-padma-bhushan-from-president-droupadi-murmu-son-dulquer-cheers-for-him", "headline": "Mammootty receives Padma Bhushan from President Droupadi Murmu , son Dulquer cheers for him"}, {"source": "Prabhat Khabar", "lean": "center", "language": "hi", "url": "https://www.prabhatkhabar.com/state/jharkhand/ranchi/d